<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reference to a resource identifier defined outside the scope of SPDX 3 content that uniquely identifies an Element."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SupportType/limitedSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The artifact has been released, and there is limited support available from the supplier. There is a validUntilDate that can provide additional information about the duration of support."@en .
